# General VCS/IDE noise
**/.git/**
**/.github/**
**/.vscode/**
**/.idea/**
**/.history/**

# Build/test artifacts
**/coverage/**
**/dist/**
**/out/**
**/tests/**

# Logs & maps
**/*.log
**/*.map

# Source you don't ship (keep JS; exclude TS sources if you compile to JS)
**/*.ts

# Node modules: exclude everywhere...
**/node_modules/**
# ...but keep the task's runtime deps
!cloudsmith-task/node_modules/**